subckt ring_amp8 (VDD VSS net4 vinp vinn net5 net7 voutp net11 net13 voutn ibias bn1)
C0 (net5 vop1) capacitor c=100f
C1 (vop1 net7) capacitor c=100f
C10 (net4 voutp) capacitor c=500f
C11 (net4 voutn) capacitor c=500f
C2 (net11 von1) capacitor c=100f
C3 (von1 net13) capacitor c=100f
